<title>FRANCE: GAN to bid 25 francs/shr for UIC.</title>
<headline>GAN to bid 25 francs/shr for UIC.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>French insurer GAN plans to pay 25 francs per share for UIC in a buy-out of the slightly over two percent of the company it does not yet own, the CMF markets supervisor said on Friday.</p>
<p>The buy-out of UIC is part of the restructuring of GAN, 80 percent owned by the state.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5542</p>
